  "goodToKnow": "Der Halbbruder is a half-brother, sharing one parent; die Halbschwester is a half-sister. Der Stiefbruder (stepbrother) shares no biological parent, only through a parent's new partner. Siblings in general are die Geschwister: Hast du Geschwister? In patchwork families, children often have both Halb- and Stiefgeschwister. Plural: die Halbbrüder."
